    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Ted Healy are delighted to bring No. 35 Pinewood Estate to the market, a well-presented two-bedroom mid-terrace property ideally positioned on the edge of Killarney town, just off the Park Road.\n\nThe property is well finished throughout and offers comfortable, low-maintenance accommodation, making it an excellent choice for a wide range of buyers. The accommodation includes two bedrooms, two bathrooms and well-proportioned living space, while the property also benefits from a covered rear yard and two useful sheds, providing excellent additional storage.\n\nThe location is a particularly attractive feature, with the property situated within easy reach of Killarney town centre and close to a wide range of local amenities. Deerpark Retail Park, Tesco and other shops and services are all within convenient proximity, while the town centre, schools, restaurants and recreational facilities are also easily accessible.\n\nNo. 35 Pinewood represents an excellent opportunity for a first-time buyer, those looking to downsize or an investor seeking a well-located property with strong rental appeal.\n\nEarly viewing is recommended to fully appreciate the quality, convenience and potential this property has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch - 1.85m x 1.03m\n\n\nEntrance Hall - 4.02m x 1.87m\nCarpeted\n\nLiving Room - 5.09m x 3.16m\nTimber floor, timber panelled ceiling, bay window\n\nKitchen - 3.98m x 3.21m\nLinoleum flooring, oak fitted kitchen\n\nRear Hall - 1.68m x 1.18m\nFitted shelving\n\nUtility Room - 1.89m x 1.21m\nPlumbed for utility appliances\n\nBathroom - 3.05m x 1.84m\nTiled, WC, WHB, Bath\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.06m x 3.05m\nCarpeted, fitted wardrobe\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.02m x 2.77m\nCarpet\n\nShower Room - 2.73m x 2.27m\nTiled, WC, WHB, Shower\n\nShed 1 - 1.72m x 2.23m\nOil tank\n\nShed 2 - 3.04m x 1.59m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> 2 bedroom mid tce property</li><li> Overlooking green area to the front</li><li> Oil central heating</li><li> PVC Double glazed windows</li><li> Covered rear yard</li><li> Well maintaned throughout</ul>"
